<translation id="5027700305690795897">I-JemaOS ayikagcwalisi ukusethwa kwayo kokuqala.</translation>
<translation id="4257170804800372451">I-JemaOS ne-Thot zenziwe zaba khona yi-<ph name="BEGIN_LINK_CHROMIUM" />Chromium<ph name="END_LINK_CHROMIUM" /> iphrojekthi yomthombo ovulekile kanye nezinye <ph name="BEGIN_LINK_OSS" />izofthiwe zomthombo ovulekile<ph name="END_LINK_OSS" />.</translation>
